[8.621,"o","== Source: chunk + Merkle + signed manifest ==\r\n"]
[8.622,"o","  payloadId 0xrover-frame-001 | chunks 10 | root 6e660a1b3f7e2df74a...\r\n"]
[8.622,"o","\r\n== Transport: 3 hops, reorder + occultation (compressed) ==\r\n"]
[8.624,"o","  occulted link L2 down@500ms up@2200ms\r\n  bundles held by the blackout: 10 of 10\r\n"]
[8.624,"o","  arrival order (first 12): 1, 9, 0, 7, 8, 2, 5, 3, 6, 4\r\n  out of order? PASS\r\n\r\n== Destination: verify each chunk against the root, out of order ==\r\n"]
[8.625,"o","  accepted 10 | rejected 0 | complete PASS\r\n"]
[8.625,"o","  reassembled == original? PASS\r\n"]
[8.625,"o","\r\n== Tamper control: flip one byte in a chunk ==\r\n"]
[8.625,"o","  tampered chunk accepted? no -> rejected (PASS)\r\n\r\n== Custody chain for one bundle ==\r\n"]
[8.625,"o","  chain verifies across 2 hops? PASS \r\n"]
[8.625,"o","\r\n== Gap object across the occultation ==\r\n"]
[8.625,"o","  gap/1 link L2 down@500ms up@2200ms duration 1700ms delayed 10 lost 0\r\n\r\n== Delivery bound to the settlement the verifier paid ==\r\n"]
[8.625,"o","  bound to MY txid? PASS\r\n"]
[8.625,"o","  bound to a DIFFERENT txid? PASS (refused: settlementRef_not_mine)\r\n"]
[8.625,"o","  UNBOUND refuses? PASS\r\n\r\n== Summary ==\r\n  chunks verified out of order, tamper rejected, custody chain intact, gap documented, delivery bound. Receipt 0xe716303eeda4135a...\r\n  (Real transport = BPv7/uD3TN + netem; real settlement = a live BSV txid. Both are marked seams.)\r\n"]
[8.626,"o","  forged hop detected? PASS (signature_invalid)\r\n"]
